This license covers the original glue code in this package: the OpenWrt
package Makefile, the uhttpd/uci-defaults wiring, usr/libexec/wrt2jb/binload,
and www/wrt2jb/t (the beacon CGI / status page).

It does NOT cover, and does not grant any rights to:

  - the RAW GAME browser exploit chain (index.html, jb.html, jb.js, core.js,
    mem.js, int64.js, rpc_worker.js, ps4_offsets.js, logo_raw.png, patches/) —
    fetched at build time from raw13g/raw13g.github.io, upstream ships no
    license of its own;
  - the bundled goldhen.bin / payload2.bin — GoldHEN is closed-source,
    binary-only, distributed by its author with no license file;
  - ps4debug-NG (fetched at build time from a pinned, hash-verified GitHub
    release, never vendored into this repository) — licensed GPL-3.0 by its
    own authors; see https://github.com/Pharaoh2k/ps4debug-NG.

See README.md § Credits & attribution for the full list. Redistribute those
components under their own upstream terms, not this one.

